  "goodToKnow": "Elend means miserable or wretched: Ich fühle mich elend (I feel awful), elende Verhältnisse. Das Elend is misery or poverty: das soziale Elend. Ein Häufchen Elend is a picture of misery. Es ist ein Elend mit dir! means you're hopeless. Originally, elend meant in another land, exiled (ali + land), because being far from home was misery. Casually, elendig and elendiglich mean the same."
